      "content": "Your feelings of heavy duty and fear of repeating your family's cycle are completely valid, but history shows that inherited patterns can change even when the odds feel stacked against you. Recognizing these signs is actually the first powerful step toward breaking the chain, because your bloodline includes strength, resilience, and the very capacity for transformation they already carry. You are not destined to ruin everything; in fact, witnessing this pain might become the inheritance you need to build the future you want.",
